both sides are troubled by the matter, both are fighting stoutly.  
The bullet has drunk plenty of blood — it has grazed Kutchia —  
yet the Kists still do not break; they stand like a fortress tower.  

Baburauled advised the Khევსurs to go down sword against sword.  
