all of Pshav-Khevsureti worships him, finding comfort in him;  
crowned Tamar is forever saying this:  
“Only let Mindia be with me, and with him the mountaineer people;  
however much the enemy may strive, he can do me no harm.”  

He knows the stratagems to defeat and crush the foe;  
if he reaches the wounded while still alive, let there be no fear of death.  
His infallible remedy will heal one cut in half;  
therefore he does not diminish in wars, and always has a great army;  
far and wide has gone the tale of his adventures.

