however much the enemy may strive, he can do me no harm.”

He knows the trick for defeating the foe and the means to crush him;  
if he reaches the wounded while they are still alive, they need not fear death.  
His incomparable remedy heals one cut in half;  
thus his forces do not diminish in war, for he always has many troops;  
far and wide has gone the tale of his adventures.

